{"seq":1,"slug":"exposure-triangle","title":"曝光三角","url":"/l-doc-books/h/creative-arts/photography/technical-foundations/exposure-triangle","wordCount":1512,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"曝光三角\">曝光三角</h1><p>把镜头对准窗外，照片可能一片惨白，也可能漆黑一团，区别只在于到达传感器的光是太多还是太少。控制这个「多少」的，是三个彼此牵制的参数：光圈、快门速度、感光度。它们被称作曝光三角，因为调动其中任何一个,都必须用另外两个来补偿,才能维持同样的亮度——这是一个零和的平衡游戏,而每一种平衡方式都会带来不同的画面副作用。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>曝光的本质是光量的累积。传感器接收到的总光能正比于光圈面积、曝光时间与场景亮度的乘积，而感光度则是对这份光能的电子放大倍数。三者共同决定最终的明暗，但各自还附带一个「代价」：光圈影响景深，快门影响运动的清晰度，感光度影响噪点。摄影者真正的工作，是在三个代价之间做权衡。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  S[场景亮度] --&gt; L[镜头]&#10;  A[光圈 f-stop&lt;br/&gt;控制进光量+景深] --&gt; L&#10;  L --&gt; SH[快门 控制时间+运动]&#10;  SH --&gt; SE[感光度 ISO 放大信号+噪点]&#10;  SE --&gt; EXP[最终曝光]&#10;  EXP --&gt;|过曝| OVER[高光溢出 细节丢失]&#10;  EXP --&gt;|欠曝| UNDER[暗部死黑 噪点抬升]&#10;  EXP --&gt;|适中| OK[正确曝光]\">flowchart TD\n  S[场景亮度] --&gt; L[镜头]\n  A[光圈 f-stop&lt;br/&gt;控制进光量+景深] --&gt; L\n  L --&gt; SH[快门 控制时间+运动]\n  SH --&gt; SE[感光度 ISO 放大信号+噪点]\n  SE --&gt; EXP[最终曝光]\n  EXP --&gt;|过曝| OVER[高光溢出 细节丢失]\n  EXP --&gt;|欠曝| UNDER[暗部死黑 噪点抬升]\n  EXP --&gt;|适中| OK[正确曝光]</pre><p>下表把三个参数的作用与副作用并列，便于一眼看清权衡关系。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>参数</th>\n<th>控制什么</th>\n<th>调大的方向</th>\n<th>主要副作用</th>\n<th>典型档位</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>光圈</td>\n<td>进光量、景深</td>\n<td>f 值变小（如 f/1.8）进光多、景深浅</td>\n<td>浅景深可能丢失对焦平面外的细节</td>\n<td>f/1.4 ~ f/22</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>快门</td>\n<td>进光时间、运动表现</td>\n<td>时间变长进光多、运动模糊</td>\n<td>手持过慢会糊；过快需更多光</td>\n<td>1/8000s ~ 30s</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>感光度</td>\n<td>信号放大</td>\n<td>ISO 变高更敏感</td>\n<td>噪点、动态范围下降</td>\n<td>ISO 100 ~ 102400</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"曝光值与对数刻度\">曝光值与对数刻度</h2><p>摄影里几乎所有的量都用「档」（stop）来度量，一档等于光量翻倍或减半。这种对数刻度并非巧合，而是因为人眼对亮度的感知本身近似对数。曝光值 EV 把光圈与快门统一进一个数：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>E</mi><mi>V</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msub><mfrac><msup><mi>N</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>t</mi></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">EV = \\log_2 \\frac{N^2}{t}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.1771em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.207em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4559em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2441em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.4911em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span> 是光圈 f 值，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6151em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span></span></span></span></span> 是快门时间（秒）。f 值之所以平方，是因为进光量正比于光圈面积，而面积正比于直径平方。这也解释了为什么标准光圈序列是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>1.4</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>f</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>2</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>f</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>2.8</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>f</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>4</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>f</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>5.6</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f/1.4, f/2, f/2.8, f/4, f/5.6</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mord\">/1.4</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mord\">/2</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mord\">/2.8</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mord\">/4</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mord\">/5.6</span></span></span></span></span>——每一档的 f 值乘以 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mo>≈</mo><mn>1.414</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sqrt{2} \\approx 1.414</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.04em;vertical-align:-0.1328em;\"></span><span class=\"mord sqrt\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9072em;\"><span class=\"svg-align\" style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"padding-left:0.833em;\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.8672em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"hide-tail\" style=\"min-width:0.853em;height:1.08em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"1.08em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 1080\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin slice\"><path d=\"M95,702\nc-2.7,0,-7.17,-2.7,-13.5,-8c-5.8,-5.3,-9.5,-10,-9.5,-14\nc0,-2,0.3,-3.3,1,-4c1.3,-2.7,23.83,-20.7,67.5,-54\nc44.2,-33.3,65.8,-50.3,66.5,-51c1.3,-1.3,3,-2,5,-2c4.7,0,8.7,3.3,12,10\ns173,378,173,378c0.7,0,35.3,-71,104,-213c68.7,-142,137.5,-285,206.5,-429\nc69,-144,104.5,-217.7,106.5,-221\nl0 -0\nc5.3,-9.3,12,-14,20,-14\nH400000v40H845.2724\ns-225.272,467,-225.272,467s-235,486,-235,486c-2.7,4.7,-9,7,-19,7\nc-6,0,-10,-1,-12,-3s-194,-422,-194,-422s-65,47,-65,47z\nM834 80h400000v40h-400000z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1328em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1.414</span></span></span></span></span>，面积恰好减半。</p>\n<p>EV 的妙处在于它把「等效曝光」变成了简单的加减法。从 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>2.8</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f/2.8</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mord\">/2.8</span></span></span></span></span>、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>250</mn><mi>s</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1/250s</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1/250</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span></span></span></span></span> 切换到 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>4</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f/4</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mord\">/4</span></span></span></span></span>、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>125</mn><mi>s</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1/125s</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1/125</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span></span></span></span></span>，光圈减一档、快门加一档，EV 不变、亮度相同，但景深变深、运动模糊增加。这种「沿等 EV 线移动」的能力，是手动曝光的核心技巧。</p>\n<h2 id=\"互易律与它的失效\">互易律与它的失效</h2><p>曝光的等效性建立在互易律（reciprocity）之上：进光量是光强与时间的乘积，所以把光强减半、时间加倍，结果应当相同。数字传感器在常规曝光区间里几乎完美遵守互易律，但在极长曝光（数十秒以上）下，热噪声会累积，长曝光降噪因此成为必要。胶片时代的互易律失效更严重——胶片在极长或极短曝光下会偏离线性，需要额外补偿，这是天文摄影和大画幅长曝光的经典难题。理解互易律何时成立、何时失效，决定了你在星空、瀑布丝绸般水流这类长曝光场景下能否预测结果。</p>\n<h2 id=\"测光与曝光补偿\">测光与曝光补偿</h2><p>相机并不知道场景「应该」多亮，它只能测量反射到镜头里的光，并假设整个画面平均下来是中性灰（反射率约 18%）。这个假设在大多数场景成立，但在以白或黑为主的画面里会失灵：拍雪景，相机会把白雪还原成灰，于是你需要正向曝光补偿把它拉回白；拍黑色背景，相机会把黑提亮成灰，需要负向补偿。</p>\n<p>测光模式提供了不同的加权策略：评价/矩阵测光综合全画面、中央重点测光偏重中心、点测光只读取很小一块区域。点测光配合曝光补偿，是控制高反差场景的精确工具。这里的曝光判断会直接影响后续的影调处理，关于影调如何在创作层面被运用，见 <a href=\"../composition-light/color-and-tone\">色彩与影调</a>；而曝光数据最终如何被传感器量化、RAW 保留了多大的补救空间，见 <a href=\"sensors-raw-color\">传感器、RAW 与色彩</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"三种曝光模式的取舍\">三种曝光模式的取舍</h2><p>光圈优先、快门优先、手动，对应三种不同的「先固定什么」的思路。下面用一个决策视角串起它们。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  Q{你最在意什么?} --&gt;|景深| AV[光圈优先 Av&lt;br/&gt;定光圈 相机算快门]&#10;  Q --&gt;|运动凝结/模糊| TV[快门优先 Tv&lt;br/&gt;定快门 相机算光圈]&#10;  Q --&gt;|光线稳定且要可复现| M[手动 M&lt;br/&gt;全部自己定]&#10;  AV --&gt; NOTE1[人像 风光常用]&#10;  TV --&gt; NOTE2[体育 流水常用]&#10;  M --&gt; NOTE3[棚拍 接片 延时常用]\">graph TD\n  Q{你最在意什么?} --&gt;|景深| AV[光圈优先 Av&lt;br/&gt;定光圈 相机算快门]\n  Q --&gt;|运动凝结/模糊| TV[快门优先 Tv&lt;br/&gt;定快门 相机算光圈]\n  Q --&gt;|光线稳定且要可复现| M[手动 M&lt;br/&gt;全部自己定]\n  AV --&gt; NOTE1[人像 风光常用]\n  TV --&gt; NOTE2[体育 流水常用]\n  M --&gt; NOTE3[棚拍 接片 延时常用]</pre><p>光圈优先适合景深是首要考量的场景，比如人像要浅景深虚化背景、风光要 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>8</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f/8</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mord\">/8</span></span></span></span></span> 到 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>11</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f/11</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mord\">/11</span></span></span></span></span> 的最佳锐度区间。这背后的景深机制由光学决定，详见 <a href=\"optics-lenses-focus\">光学、镜头与对焦</a>。快门优先适合运动主导的场景。手动模式则在光线恒定（如影棚）或要求多张曝光一致（如接片、延时）时不可替代——关于影棚布光为何让手动曝光成为标配，见 <a href=\"../composition-light/natural-and-artificial-light\">自然光与人工布光</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>曝光由光圈、快门、感光度三者共同决定，调一个必须补偿另两个，这就是曝光三角。</li>\n<li>一档等于光量翻倍或减半；EV 用对数刻度把光圈与快门统一，等效曝光是沿等 EV 线的加减法。</li>\n<li>f 值的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sqrt{2}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.04em;vertical-align:-0.1328em;\"></span><span class=\"mord sqrt\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9072em;\"><span class=\"svg-align\" style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"padding-left:0.833em;\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.8672em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"hide-tail\" style=\"min-width:0.853em;height:1.08em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"1.08em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 1080\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin slice\"><path d=\"M95,702\nc-2.7,0,-7.17,-2.7,-13.5,-8c-5.8,-5.3,-9.5,-10,-9.5,-14\nc0,-2,0.3,-3.3,1,-4c1.3,-2.7,23.83,-20.7,67.5,-54\nc44.2,-33.3,65.8,-50.3,66.5,-51c1.3,-1.3,3,-2,5,-2c4.7,0,8.7,3.3,12,10\ns173,378,173,378c0.7,0,35.3,-71,104,-213c68.7,-142,137.5,-285,206.5,-429\nc69,-144,104.5,-217.7,106.5,-221\nl0 -0\nc5.3,-9.3,12,-14,20,-14\nH400000v40H845.2724\ns-225.272,467,-225.272,467s-235,486,-235,486c-2.7,4.7,-9,7,-19,7\nc-6,0,-10,-1,-12,-3s-194,-422,-194,-422s-65,47,-65,47z\nM834 80h400000v40h-400000z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1328em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 序列源于「面积正比于直径平方」，这是理解光圈刻度的关键。</li>\n<li>互易律让等效曝光成立，但在极长曝光下因热噪声/胶片特性而失效，需要长曝光降噪或补偿。</li>\n<li>相机测光假设画面平均为 18% 中性灰，高调与低调场景需用曝光补偿纠偏，点测光提供最精确控制。</li>\n<li>三种曝光模式的差别是「先固定什么」，选择取决于景深、运动、可复现性中你最在意哪一个。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"曝光三角","id":"曝光三角"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"曝光值与对数刻度","id":"曝光值与对数刻度"},{"level":2,"text":"互易律与它的失效","id":"互易律与它的失效"},{"level":2,"text":"测光与曝光补偿","id":"测光与曝光补偿"},{"level":2,"text":"三种曝光模式的取舍","id":"三种曝光模式的取舍"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":null,"next":{"title":"光学、镜头与对焦","url":"/l-doc-books/h/creative-arts/photography/technical-foundations/optics-lenses-focus"}}